# This repo publishes the spinup SKILLS and nothing else. Everything at the root is
# ignored by default; only skills/ (and this file) is tracked. Local working docs
# (CLAUDE.md, SPINUP-RUNBOOK.md, GOTCHAS.md, SKILLS.md, HANDOFF-*.md), scripts/ and
# test-fixtures/ stay on disk but are deliberately NOT published.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/skills/
# README.md is the one root doc that IS published: it is the landing page and the
# install instructions, and a repo whose skills nobody can install is inert. It is
# written to carry no ids, comp figures or internal links. Added 2026-08-07.
!/README.md

# Secrets. Never commit a real key; see each skill's *.env.example for the shape.
spinup.env
*.env
!*.env.example
.env*
!.env.example

# Script side-effects
backup_*.json

# macOS
.DS_Store
._*

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/

# Stop-hook sync side-effects
.sync-skills.log
.sync-skills.lock/
